  "body": "Mocking `Transformation.class` with Mockito returns a raw type, causing\nan unchecked conversion to `Transformation<SourceRecord>`.\n\n```\n> Task :connect:runtime:compileTestJava\nNote:\n/Users/parker/opensource/kafka/connect/runtime/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/connect/runtime/WorkerTest.java\nuses unchecked or unsafe operations.\nNote: Recompile with -Xlint:unchecked for details.\n```\n\nAdd a local `@SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")`, following the existing\napproach in `TransformationStageTest.applyAndAssert`.\n\nValidation:\n- `./gradlew :connect:runtime:compileTestJava --rerun-tasks`\n- The unchecked message for WorkerTest.java no longer appeared.\n\nReviewers: Ken Huang <s7133700@gmail.com>, Chia-Ping Tsai\n <chia7712@gmail.com>\n",
